# Atelloune's Lament (sandoria 114): 890 finished with option 0 (begun: any option begins it); then complete fails
# twice and the wing stays. A full inventory (891: no room for the gloves: not completed, the wing kept); then, with
# room, the Trainee Gloves already held (GM; rare: giveItem refuses them, not completed, the wing kept). The main flow
# takes the true side.
lists SouthernSanDoria/Atelloune/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/Atelloune/onTrade SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/890 SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/891
char zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=124.9,0.0,84.7 job=WAR lvl=30
fame Sandoria 50
quest CrystalWar.SeeingSpots completed
item LadybugWing
login
trigger Atelloune                         # fame level 2, Seeing Spots completed: 890
finish option=0                           # begun (option 0 too)
fill-inventory
trade Atelloune LadybugWing x1            # 891
finish                                    # no room for the gloves: not completed; the wing kept
free-inventory
item TraineeGloves                        # GM: the rare gloves already held
trade Atelloune LadybugWing x1            # 891
finish                                    # the gloves held (rare): not completed; the wing kept
